&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Temporal.io, graph/map visualization, or regulated industry products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language (B1+) or prior work with defense/law-enforcement customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
